{{!-- Table/Board toggle for a relationships section.

      Its own partial because it is placed in DIFFERENT parents on different sheets: on the
      character and steading sheets it rides in the section's heading row (far right, on the
      heading's own line, above the underline), while the NPC sheet's relationships tab has
      no heading at all, so there it stays inside the section body.

      Each button therefore carries its own `data-resize-key`. The click handler is delegated
      from the SHEET ROOT and identifies its table from that attribute, so the toolbar can
      live anywhere on the sheet without the wiring caring — moving it does not have to move
      a listener too.

      Params: resizeKey, view ("table" | "board"), inHeading.

      Buttons, not the radio inputs .stonetop-segmented-picker normally pairs with: a NAMED
      input inside an actor sheet's form is submitted into _updateObject and lands in
      expandObject(formData) as a stray top-level key, and radios are only mutually exclusive
      when they share a name. Same reason the show/hide checkbox is unnamed. --}}
{{!-- In a heading it also wears stonetop-section-heading-control, which is what makes folding
      the section fold the toggle with it (see _wireSectionCollapse). In the NPC sheet's
      headingless tab there is nothing to fold, so it does not. --}}
<div class="stonetop-rel-viewbar{{#if inHeading}} stonetop-rel-viewbar--heading stonetop-section-heading-control{{/if}}">
	<div class="stonetop-segmented-picker stonetop-rel-viewpicker" role="group"
	     aria-label='{{localize "stonetop.relationships.view.label"}}'>
		<button type="button"
		        class="stonetop-segmented-picker-option stonetop-rel-view-btn{{#unless (eq view "board")}} is-active{{/unless}}"
		        data-resize-key="{{this.resizeKey}}" data-rel-view="table"
		        aria-pressed="{{#unless (eq view "board")}}true{{else}}false{{/unless}}"
		        data-tooltip='{{localize "stonetop.relationships.view.tableTooltip"}}'>
			<i class="fa-solid fa-table-list" aria-hidden="true"></i>
			<span>{{localize "stonetop.relationships.view.table"}}</span>
		</button>
		<button type="button"
		        class="stonetop-segmented-picker-option stonetop-rel-view-btn{{#if (eq view "board")}} is-active{{/if}}"
		        data-resize-key="{{this.resizeKey}}" data-rel-view="board"
		        aria-pressed="{{#if (eq view "board")}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}"
		        data-tooltip='{{localize "stonetop.relationships.view.boardTooltip"}}'>
			<i class="fa-solid fa-table-columns" aria-hidden="true"></i>
			<span>{{localize "stonetop.relationships.view.board"}}</span>
		</button>
	</div>
</div>
